OL,3,AThree people killed in Houthi attacks
OL,4,Aon Saudi Arabia airports, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been killed in
OL,7,Fattacks on Saudi Arabia airports over
OL,8,Ftwo days, authorities said, as flare-up
OL,9,Fof fighting spilled across the Yemen
OL,10,Fborder into the kingdom.
OL,12,FTwo people were killed and 28 wounded
OL,13,Fin an attack at Abha International
OL,14,FAirport, Saudi Arabia's General
OL,15,FAuthority of Civil Aviation (Gaca) said
OL,16,Fin a statement on Wednesday.
OL,18,FIn a separate incident, one person was
OL,19,Fkilled and eight were wounded in an
OL,20,Fattack on King Khalid International
OL,21,FAirport in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia's
OL,22,Fcapital, it added.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
