OL,3,AThree people killed in Houthi attacks
OL,4,Aon Saudi Arabia airports, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attacks, which the Houthis have
OL,7,Fclaimed responsibility for, mark an
OL,8,Fescalation in the renewed war between
OL,9,Fthe Saudi-backed government forces and
OL,10,Fthe Iran-backed Houthis in Yemen.
